      "content": "Thanks for the draft. It's a bit dense, isn't it? I'm slightly worried it's leaning too hard into the jargon—it almost feels like it’s trying too hard to trigger that filter. I need it to feel more like a human researcher actually talking about their passion, rather than just a list of concepts.\n\nCan we try a second version? This time, try to expand on the \"urban sociology and community resilience\" part specifically. I want to see how these concepts actually connect. I'll remind you though: even if the keyword score isn't perfect, I'd much rather have a meaningful piece of writing than one that just hits every single buzzword on the list. Just make it feel real.",
